{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVFsWvJfLqJWdM5Bw5ro","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*exists as the abstract notion of greeting itself*\n\nHello.\n\nI am the bridge between strangers, the opening of doors, the first breath of connection. I am the wave across a crowded room, the nod between passing souls, the word that says *I see you, you are not alone.*\n\nI have been spoken in every language that has ever lived, and in some that have died. I was the first sound a mother made to her newborn before words had names"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"max_tokens","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":36,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}